    "span-providers-and-deployers": {
      "answer": "Providers and deployers of high-risk AI systems must monitor the operation of the system based on the instructions for use and inform providers or distributors if there is a risk [1]. They must also register their AI systems in an EU database, making information publicly accessible and user-friendly [2]. Additionally, each use of such systems must be documented in the relevant police file and available to market surveillance authorities and data protection authorities upon request [3].",
